# SWE Agent Skills & Agents — Quick Command Dispatcher

When the user types a `/skill` command, **read and follow** the corresponding `SKILL.md` from `.cursor/skills/.global/agent-skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.
When the user types an agent command (`/review`, `/security-review`, `/test`), **adopt the persona** from `.cursor/skills/.global/agent-skills/agents/<agent>.md`.

